WEBVTT

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:03.770
<i>My name is Hiiragi Seiichi. 
I'm a second-year in high school.</i>

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:05.980
<i>I ate some Fruit of Evolution 
in another world</i>

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:08.480
<i>and got an invincible, OP physique!</i>

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:11.490
<i>I recently entered the Royal Cup 
with a donkey named Lulune.</i>

00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:14.610
<i>After eating a Fruit of Evolution,</i>

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:17.320
<i>Lulune defeated some monsters 
and left all the racers behind.</i>

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:21.340
The winners are Hiiragi Seiichi and Lulune!

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:24.800
<i>Then something unbelievable happened!</i>

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:27.840
Master!

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:29.840
<i>She turned into a beautiful woman?!</i>

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:32.840
<i>Wh-What's going on in my 
life in another world?!</i>

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:40.170
You're... Lulune, right?

00:00:40.170 --> 00:00:42.650
Master! Something's not right!

00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:44.120
My body is...

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:45.230
I can see it! I can see it!

00:00:45.950 --> 00:00:48.480
C-Calm down! I'll explain it all to you!

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:52.490
Hey, Seiichi, what are you doing?

00:00:52.490 --> 00:00:54.590
Uh, I... No, wait!

00:00:54.590 --> 00:00:55.960
I-It's not what you think!

00:00:55.960 --> 00:00:57.240
It's not that, Ar!

00:00:57.240 --> 00:00:59.990
Is that all you have to say for yourself?

00:01:00.140 --> 00:01:01.990
<b>\hC
r\h
\ha
c\h
\hk</b>

00:01:16.930 --> 00:01:20.180
<b>The Fruit of Evolution:</b>

00:01:16.930 --> 00:01:20.180
<b>\h\hBefore I Knew It,

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:46.080
<b>Beautiful Valkyrie</b>

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:46.340
So you're saying this woman 
is your donkey, Lulune,

00:02:46.340 --> 00:02:48.240
after eating a Fruit of Evolution?

00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:49.520
Yes.

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:52.520
Can't you come up with any better excuses?

00:02:53.220 --> 00:02:55.770
But I can't help what's already happened!

00:02:55.770 --> 00:02:59.200
Hey, Ar, Seiichi is telling the truth.

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:02.030
Huh? You're defending him, too, Saria?

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:04.780
Ar, look at me.

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:09.690
I was originally a monster.

00:03:09.690 --> 00:03:12.980
But I ate the Fruit of Evolution 
and became a Human.

00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:15.540
See?

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:18.760
A-Ar?

00:03:22.330 --> 00:03:23.890
Come with me!

00:03:25.940 --> 00:03:27.230
Ar!

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:31.890
<b>20 Minutes Later</b>

00:03:33.260 --> 00:03:34.400
What do you think?

00:03:35.550 --> 00:03:37.650
Does it look good on me?

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:40.370
It looks great on you, Lulune-chan!

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:42.660
Ar, your fashion sense is amazing.

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:44.160
R-Really?

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:46.960
Um, thank you so much!

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:48.410
Hello!

00:03:51.450 --> 00:03:54.720
Lorna, you're not here to challenge anyone.

00:03:54.720 --> 00:03:57.060
There's no need to make that kind of entrance.

00:03:57.550 --> 00:03:58.670
Tee-hee.

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:01.170
Uh, and you are?

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:02.640
Oh, pardon me.

00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:07.790
I'm one of this nation's Valkyries, 
Claudia Asterio.

00:04:08.410 --> 00:04:11.680
Likewise, a Valkyrie, Lorna Kirizas!

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:14.510
You're Hiiragi Seiichi-kun, yes?

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:17.730
Huh? Y-Yes...

00:04:18.100 --> 00:04:19.920
Could you hold out both your hands?

00:04:19.920 --> 00:04:21.690
L-Like this?

00:04:24.730 --> 00:04:25.510
Huh?!

00:04:26.670 --> 00:04:30.260
We've been ordered to bring you in.

00:04:30.260 --> 00:04:33.300
Why? Did I do something wrong?

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:36.220
Now, would you come with us for a bit?

00:04:36.220 --> 00:04:36.900
Wai—

00:04:36.900 --> 00:04:40.370
Give it up! This is the end of your evildoing!

00:04:40.370 --> 00:04:43.040
Lorna, that's enough overdoing it.

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:47.220
I-I'm innocent!

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:48.850
Seiichi!

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:50.470
Master!

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:11.510
Captain of the Demon Lord's Army, Third Division
Leia Falzar

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:10.180
Leia Falzar, Captain of the 
Demon Lord's Army, Third Division.

00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:11.740
I've just arrived.

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:17.350
Captain of the Demon Lord's Army, Second Division
 Zolua Waltorre

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:15.770
Hey, Liaretta, are we starting yet?

00:05:15.770 --> 00:05:17.880
I want to go home and sleep.

00:05:17.640 --> 00:05:24.650
Captain of the Demon Lord's Army, First Division
 Xellos Albarna

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:20.760
Zolua, are you going to trouble Lutia-sama

00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:24.760
with your whims after 
she summoned us here?

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:27.470
No mischief from either of you, okay?

00:05:24.940 --> 00:05:31.400
Captain of the Demon Lord's Army, Penal Division
 Jade Raven

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:31.510
Or do you want some of my punishment?

00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:36.910
Captain of the Demon Lord's Army, Fifth Division
 Urus Bashew

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:33.620
Hey, Leia!

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:37.030
What are you thinking, showing up 
late for an important meeting?

00:05:37.210 --> 00:05:42.920
Captain of the Demon Lord's Army, Fourth Division
 Liaretta Valheim

00:05:37.450 --> 00:05:40.050
Urus is right, Leia.

00:05:40.050 --> 00:05:43.030
You should arrive on time, you know.

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:46.650
Is Lutia-sama not here yet?

00:05:55.100 --> 00:05:59.420
Demon Lord's Daughter
 Lutia Butte

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:59.420
Everyone, thank you for 
responding to my summons.

00:05:59.640 --> 00:06:04.320
Demon Lord's Aide
 Kreis

00:06:01.570 --> 00:06:03.600
Thank you, indeed!

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:06.920
Kreis, quiet.

00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:09.930
Lutia-sama, what did you need?

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:15.180
The reason I have gathered the captains of 
all Demon Lord's Army divisions today...

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:24.940
is because I wish to discuss an 
alliance with Wimberg Kingdom.

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:30.420
Wh-What is this you speak of?!

00:06:30.420 --> 00:06:32.220
You would forge an alliance with the humans

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:34.400
that have persecuted demons 
for many long years?

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:38.600
The same humans who sealed away 
your father, the Demon Lord?!

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:42.460
That is all the more reason we need 
to bring our peoples closer together.

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:44.650
This makes no sense!

00:06:44.650 --> 00:06:46.640
Have you gone mad?!

00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:49.100
I hear the King of Wimberg

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:53.470
is proactively building friendly 
relations with demons.

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:55.020
Lutia-sama.

00:06:55.020 --> 00:06:56.850
What is it, Leia?

00:06:56.850 --> 00:07:00.210
I have heard that the Black Dragon 
God was most likely defeated

00:07:00.210 --> 00:07:04.230
by a single human from 
the Kingdom of Wimberg.

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:05.740
Impossible!

00:07:05.740 --> 00:07:09.990
The Black Dragon God was the strongest 
member of the Demon Lord's army.

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:12.990
A mere human, defeated such a great figure?

00:07:13.230 --> 00:07:15.180
According to the Black Dragon God,

00:07:15.180 --> 00:07:18.780
he lost to a human named "Seiichi."

00:07:20.610 --> 00:07:23.790
Yosetsukaff, Ufeclad, Rakiamayarito.

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:30.510
Yosetsukaff, Ufeclad, Rakiamayarito.

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:36.000
Loyal servant of the 
Demon Lord, Black Dragon God,

00:07:36.000 --> 00:07:37.820
I summon your soul here now!

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:42.730
Black Dragon God!

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:44.820
I lost, then?

00:07:44.820 --> 00:07:48.100
I'll gather the strongest forces 
of each demon army at once

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:49.820
and set out to avenge you.

00:07:50.180 --> 00:07:50.900
No.

00:07:52.630 --> 00:07:56.350
At one time, I hated humans.

00:07:56.350 --> 00:08:01.430
However, that man challenged 
me fair and square, and I lost.

00:08:01.430 --> 00:08:02.960
I have no regrets.

00:08:03.470 --> 00:08:05.290
Black Dragon God?!

00:08:08.310 --> 00:08:11.700
Fair and square? Absolutely absurd!

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:16.930
Our Demon Lord's army has been the 
brunt of countless dastardly tricks!

00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:19.850
We cannot cling to our harsh past forever.

00:08:19.850 --> 00:08:23.670
To truly return smiles to our people,

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:27.020
I believe we must coexist with humans.

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:32.490
R-Right! Lutia-sama, the prophecy!
Remember the prophecy?

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:35.280
It was foretold that getting 
involved with humans

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:37.790
would bring great calamity to us demons!

00:08:37.790 --> 00:08:39.620
We should stop this at once!

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:43.120
If that comes to pass, 
I shall offer up my head.

00:08:43.590 --> 00:08:44.700
Impossible!

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:47.500
Our people will never accept such a trifle!

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:51.700
Hey, pig. What do you mean by "trifle"?

00:08:52.030 --> 00:08:54.310
Be quiet and follow Lutia-sama,

00:08:54.310 --> 00:08:55.630
or I'll crush you.

00:08:57.520 --> 00:09:00.540
I don't like the fact that I agree with you,

00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:03.140
but I wouldn't mind 
eliminating him right now.

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:08.650
Want to savor some hot punishment?

00:09:12.020 --> 00:09:13.550
M-Mark my words!

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:17.660
You'll learn how foolish it is 
to form an alliance with humans!

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:24.370
We have to move forward.

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:26.920
So lend me your strength.

00:09:29.390 --> 00:09:32.420
We stand with the Demon Lord!

00:09:33.290 --> 00:09:34.560
Thank you.

00:09:35.640 --> 00:09:37.860
Damn it! Damn it, damn it!

00:09:37.860 --> 00:09:40.430
Now all my plans will be...

00:09:40.990 --> 00:09:44.860
Well, my plans may have been thrown 
off, but I can still correct course.

00:09:44.860 --> 00:09:48.560
No one will be able to stop me!

00:09:56.480 --> 00:10:00.450
This is the castle of the Kingdom 
of Wimberg, Arkshell Castle.

00:10:00.860 --> 00:10:02.540
Incredible...

00:10:07.150 --> 00:10:10.410
But would you all please tell me 
what this is about already?

00:10:11.370 --> 00:10:15.060
Seiichi-kun, you won the 
Royal Cup, didn't you?

00:10:15.060 --> 00:10:16.210
What about it?

00:10:16.210 --> 00:10:17.930
Did you forget?

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:23.640
The winner earned the right to 
spend a day with us Valkyries.

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:25.960
That's what these manacles are for?!

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:29.730
We don't have much free time, 
despite what you may think! V!

00:10:29.730 --> 00:10:32.790
Forget the V! Just release me from these!

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:34.520
Fine, fine.

00:10:36.040 --> 00:10:37.740
I'm finally free.

00:10:38.600 --> 00:10:42.290
Now, look! This is the Kingdom
of Wimberg's training ground!

00:10:42.290 --> 00:10:45.390
By the way, there's a barrier 
here that won't budge even when

00:10:45.390 --> 00:10:47.750
the mages cast magic at full strength!

00:10:48.190 --> 00:10:51.590
Well, Louise-sama would never 
let them do that, either.

00:10:51.590 --> 00:10:55.780
Uh, is this Louise-sama that scary?

00:10:55.780 --> 00:10:57.790
S-S-S-Scary doesn't cut it.

00:10:57.790 --> 00:10:59.510
She's a devil! A devil!

00:11:01.360 --> 00:11:03.760
This is perfect timing. 
Seiichi-kun, look over there.

00:11:04.420 --> 00:11:07.270
That's the training we Valkyries go through.

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:12.520
And the one in the center 
is our captain, Louise-sama.

00:11:18.230 --> 00:11:20.190
Rose of Somesailles?

00:11:23.600 --> 00:11:25.990
Please watch closely!

00:11:25.990 --> 00:11:28.200
It'll be over in an instant!

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:41.640
So fast!

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:44.970
<i>Even with Sixth Sense, I couldn't see it.</i>

00:11:45.360 --> 00:11:47.270
You're getting faster with your sword,

00:11:47.270 --> 00:11:49.430
but your attacks are too straightforward.

00:11:49.430 --> 00:11:50.720
Work on improving that.

00:11:50.720 --> 00:11:52.460
Thank you very much!

00:11:53.120 --> 00:11:54.980
You're both back?

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:56.720
Yes, we've brought him here.

00:11:56.720 --> 00:11:58.480
That was perfect!

00:11:59.490 --> 00:12:01.410
So you're Seiichi-san?

00:12:01.410 --> 00:12:02.370
Yes.

00:12:02.370 --> 00:12:06.240
I lead the Valkyries of 
the Kingdom of Wimberg.

00:12:06.550 --> 00:12:07.890
I'm Louise Balze.

00:12:07.890 --> 00:12:10.220
N-Nice to meet you.

00:12:10.220 --> 00:12:10.990
Likewise.

00:12:10.990 --> 00:12:12.250
Huh?

00:12:14.250 --> 00:12:16.750
Now, shall we have a mock battle?

00:12:17.360 --> 00:12:19.000
Can I go home?

00:12:24.610 --> 00:12:27.010
Now, here I come.

00:12:27.010 --> 00:12:29.510
Hey... H-Hey!

00:12:29.510 --> 00:12:32.210
Don't worry, it's a wooden sword.

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:35.770
H-Hold on!

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:42.680
So this is Barbador Academy?

00:12:42.680 --> 00:12:45.270
What's going to happen to us now?

00:12:45.270 --> 00:12:47.530
For now, let's just see how things go.

00:12:47.930 --> 00:12:49.360
Kannazuki-senpai.

00:12:49.360 --> 00:12:50.920
Let's go, too.

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:55.880
What's this?

00:12:55.880 --> 00:12:59.040
Well, if it isn't the student council president.

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:00.960
Ooyama.

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:03.300
And Kenji, too.

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:05.050
Ooyama-senpai.

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:08.190
I'm surprised you were able to come here,

00:13:08.190 --> 00:13:10.310
when you were so weak in the boxing club.

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:11.490
What?!

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:13.020
Don't, Kenji.

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:14.310
What did you need?

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:19.990
Hey, we're all able to fight monsters now, 
so since we're back together and all,

00:13:19.990 --> 00:13:21.820
why don't we have a little match?

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:23.320
A match?

00:13:23.700 --> 00:13:28.190
Let's see whether you all can 
defeat more monsters than us.

00:13:28.190 --> 00:13:29.730
Sounds good.

00:13:29.730 --> 00:13:32.840
I'll go easy on you.

00:13:34.270 --> 00:13:35.080
Hey!

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:39.580
That hurt!

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:44.090
Sorry, but I don't have time to go 
along with your tasteless match.

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:45.790
What?!

00:13:45.790 --> 00:13:47.050
Now, now.

00:13:47.050 --> 00:13:48.820
That's our president for you.

00:13:48.820 --> 00:13:50.640
Such a goody-two-shoes.

00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:53.360
Neither of us knows left from right here.

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:55.600
So let's all get along, okay?

00:13:58.690 --> 00:14:01.110
What's their deal?

00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:03.460
Kannazuki Karen, huh?

00:14:03.770 --> 00:14:08.110
I'll show you what happens when you defy us.

00:14:14.520 --> 00:14:15.810
I'm stunned.

00:14:15.810 --> 00:14:18.710
I didn't expect you to so easily 
dodge my opening strike.

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:21.210
It wasn't easy at all!

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:22.540
Very well.

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:24.230
Then I'll use my full might next time.

00:14:24.230 --> 00:14:26.210
You're not listening!

00:14:32.140 --> 00:14:34.180
<i>Damn it! She's not giving me a choice!</i>

00:14:34.780 --> 00:14:36.880
Man, he's good.

00:14:36.880 --> 00:14:41.520
I'm surprised there's someone so adept at 
continually dodging Louise-sama's attacks.

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:44.020
Just who is he, anyway?

00:14:51.900 --> 00:14:53.990
I'm truly stunned.

00:14:53.990 --> 00:14:56.790
I didn't think my serious 
attacks wouldn't work.

00:14:57.140 --> 00:14:59.540
Can we end this already?

00:14:59.540 --> 00:15:03.060
Yes, I'll end it with this blow.

00:15:03.060 --> 00:15:06.800
Please, listen to me!

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:11.930
<i>Oh, no!</i>

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:13.840
<i>Skill: Adaptation activating.</i>

00:15:13.840 --> 00:15:20.310
<i>Skill: Sixth Sense merged with skill: 
Enemy Detection into skill: World Vision.</i>

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:25.200
<i>Furthermore, skill: 
Reflexive Defense acquired.</i>

00:15:48.820 --> 00:15:49.920
No, no, no!

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:53.740
Why are you just as shocked 
as the rest of us?!

00:15:53.740 --> 00:15:54.760
I mean, come on!

00:15:54.760 --> 00:15:58.560
Even I don't know why I was able 
to move like that all of a sudden!

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:06.370
Uh...

00:16:06.370 --> 00:16:07.470
Seiichi-dono...

00:16:07.470 --> 00:16:08.110
Huh?

00:16:08.740 --> 00:16:11.110
May I call you Master?

00:16:11.430 --> 00:16:13.580
Wh-What?

00:16:15.710 --> 00:16:18.490
Please take good care of me, Master.

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:20.370
Are you kidding me?!

00:16:21.190 --> 00:16:23.250
Seiichi-kun, do you have a moment?

00:16:24.440 --> 00:16:26.550
There's something I want 
to talk to you about.

00:16:26.550 --> 00:16:28.250
O-Okay...

00:16:35.950 --> 00:16:37.150
Pardon me.

00:16:38.380 --> 00:16:41.380
Your Majesty, the bath is prepared.

00:16:42.430 --> 00:16:43.640
Good work.

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:53.650
Now, how's the bath water today?

00:16:54.430 --> 00:16:57.020
You're strong, Seiichi-kun.

00:16:57.020 --> 00:17:00.270
Or should I call you Master Seiichi?

00:17:00.270 --> 00:17:02.160
Please give me a break.

00:17:02.160 --> 00:17:05.120
Actually, I wanted to thank you.

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:05.920
Huh?

00:17:07.740 --> 00:17:13.510
Louise-sama has been a genius with 
the sword since the day she was born.

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:15.340
I'm sure.

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:18.930
But she can't use any skills or magic.

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:23.430
No, no, no. She was 
launching slashes like crazy.

00:17:23.760 --> 00:17:29.190
She can recreate any swordsmanship 
she's witnessed with her own technique

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:31.690
rather than as a skill.

00:17:31.990 --> 00:17:34.690
Th-That's an incredible talent.

00:17:35.300 --> 00:17:39.700
The only one who could measure 
up to her was the Black Paladin.

00:17:40.240 --> 00:17:42.920
Which is why Louise-sama is always...

00:17:43.240 --> 00:17:43.960
Huh?

00:17:45.030 --> 00:17:46.610
Louise-san?

00:17:46.610 --> 00:17:48.000
Louise-sama...

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:53.490
Seiichi-dono, please forgive me for calling 
you Master without permission earlier.

00:17:53.490 --> 00:17:55.100
No, no, it's fine.

00:17:55.520 --> 00:17:57.000
Thank you.

00:17:57.000 --> 00:17:57.690
Huh?

00:17:58.180 --> 00:18:00.100
For saving me.

00:18:00.450 --> 00:18:02.850
Uh, what do you mean?

00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:06.680
I've always been alone.

00:18:09.920 --> 00:18:12.090
I've wielded a sword since I was young.

00:18:14.990 --> 00:18:18.060
Y-You're a genius, Louise-sama!

00:18:18.060 --> 00:18:20.160
The stronger I became...

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:29.920
Who's next?

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:32.730
No, please stop!

00:18:32.730 --> 00:18:34.940
We can't beat a genius!

00:18:34.940 --> 00:18:36.690
...the more walls grew between me and others.

00:18:36.690 --> 00:18:38.780
So cool!

00:18:38.780 --> 00:18:40.590
She's a genius!

00:18:45.610 --> 00:18:48.220
I never had anyone I could call a friend.

00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:55.110
Seiichi-kun.

00:18:55.760 --> 00:18:58.840
You're the one who saved Louise-sama.

00:18:58.840 --> 00:19:00.590
So thank you.

00:19:00.590 --> 00:19:01.730
No, I didn't...

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:03.160
Claudia.

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:07.620
Thank you so much for always 
being so concerned for me.

00:19:07.840 --> 00:19:10.360
Wh-What are you saying?

00:19:10.360 --> 00:19:12.630
I... I...

00:19:13.120 --> 00:19:14.460
Claudia...

00:19:15.850 --> 00:19:18.630
L-Louise-sama!

00:19:24.590 --> 00:19:28.210
<i>Being alone is hard.</i>

00:19:30.670 --> 00:19:31.550
Um...

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:34.900
If you really think I'll suffice...

00:19:35.120 --> 00:19:38.650
Once again, please take 
good care of me, Master!

00:19:38.890 --> 00:19:39.930
Sure.

00:19:39.930 --> 00:19:44.910
Though... I don't think there's 
much I'll be able to teach you.

00:19:45.180 --> 00:19:47.940
That's fine! I'll watch you and steal what I see!

00:19:47.940 --> 00:19:49.410
No, no, no, no, no, no, no!

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:51.880
<i>Skill: Instructor acquired.</i>

00:19:53.410 --> 00:19:55.350
Seriously?

00:19:55.350 --> 00:19:58.300
Now, Master, let's spar at once!

00:19:58.300 --> 00:20:00.230
H-Hold on!

00:20:05.570 --> 00:20:06.740
The king!

00:20:06.740 --> 00:20:07.810
What's going on?

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:10.560
Someone has attacked the king!

00:20:11.190 --> 00:20:13.190
Stay here. It's too dangerous for you.

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:16.210
Master, please return home for today.

00:20:16.210 --> 00:20:17.940
What are you saying? I'll—

00:20:18.620 --> 00:20:22.210
Seiichi-kun, we can't involve 
an outsider like you.

00:20:22.210 --> 00:20:24.680
I'm sorry, but we're done for today!

00:20:24.680 --> 00:20:26.020
Hey, wait...

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:30.950
Okay, I'll take you up on that offer.

00:20:37.110 --> 00:20:39.710
As if I could just go home 
after coming all the way here!

00:20:40.560 --> 00:20:42.690
Skill: World Vision!

00:20:49.510 --> 00:20:51.090
<i>This one's the culprit?</i>

00:20:54.770 --> 00:20:57.220
<i>The assassin is just a child?</i>

00:22:35.310 --> 00:22:36.350
Time for...

00:22:36.350 --> 00:22:38.490
..."Seiichi's Status for Today"!

00:22:38.810 --> 00:22:41.740
