00:22:45.900 --> 00:22:47.600
His new skill, World Vision!

00:22:47.600 --> 00:22:49.760
Cu-chan, what kind of skill is this?

00:22:49.760 --> 00:22:51.850
Apparently, it allows minute Enemy Detection.

00:22:51.850 --> 00:22:54.300
It also increases the 
effects of Sixth Sense,

00:22:54.300 --> 00:22:57.680
allowing him to react at even 
greater speeds than before.

00:22:57.680 --> 00:22:59.770
By the way, his Reflexive Defense

00:22:59.770 --> 00:23:02.400
is a skill that allows him to 
automatically take defensive action

00:23:02.400 --> 00:23:04.880
against attacks he's unable to respond to.

00:23:04.880 --> 00:23:08.230
Which means he can avoid 
enemies' attacks with ease!

00:23:08.230 --> 00:23:09.780
More importantly, Lorna...

00:23:10.120 --> 00:23:11.530
What is it, Cu-chan?

00:23:11.530 --> 00:23:15.120
Do you think Louise-sama 
is falling for Seiichi-kun?

00:23:15.120 --> 00:23:15.800
Oh?

00:23:15.800 --> 00:23:18.410
You think they'll develop beyond 
just Master and student?!

00:23:18.690 --> 00:23:20.590
Wouldn't it be great if they did?

00:23:20.590 --> 00:23:24.530
True, I'd love to see 
Louise-sama lost in love!

00:23:24.530 --> 00:23:26.130
So good, right?!

00:23:26.130 --> 00:23:29.050
I'm looking forward to how it plays out!

00:23:31.030 --> 00:23:32.890
L-Louise-sama?!

00:23:32.890 --> 00:23:34.970
How long have you been there?!

00:23:35.840 --> 00:23:38.720
Seiichi chases after the 
assassin who attacked the king.

00:23:38.720 --> 00:23:41.380
The culprit turns out to be another cute girl!

00:23:41.380 --> 00:23:44.110
But why would a little girl 
like this do such a thing?

00:23:44.110 --> 00:23:46.500
Next time: "Black Cat Oliga."

00:23:44.110 --> 00:23:50.250
<b>Next Time
Black Cat Oliga</b>

00:23:46.500 --> 00:23:48.730
